#include &lt;iostream&gt;#include &lt;cstdio&gt;#include &lt;cstring&gt;#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;#include &lt;algorithm&gt;#define ULL unsigned long long #define MAXS 1500#define MAXN 10000using namespace std;ULL hsa[MAXN + 5];int ans;int main() &#123;    int n, sn;    char nows[MAXS + 5];    scanf(&quot;%d&quot;, &amp;n);    for (int i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++) &#123;        scanf(&quot;%s&quot;, nows);        sn = strlen(nows);        ULL nowi = 0;        for (int j = 0; j &lt;= sn; j++) &#123;            nowi = nowi * 62;            if (nows[j] &gt;= &#x27;0&#x27; &amp;&amp; nows[j] &lt;= &#x27;9&#x27;)                nowi += nows[j] - &#x27;0&#x27;;            else if (nows[j] &gt;= &#x27;a&#x27; &amp;&amp; nows[j] &lt;= &#x27;z&#x27;)                nowi += nows[j] - &#x27;a&#x27; + 10;            else                nowi += nows[j] - &#x27;A&#x27; + 36;        &#125;        hsa[++hsa[0]] = nowi;    &#125;    sort(hsa, hsa + n + 1);    printf(&quot;%d&quot;, unique(hsa, hsa + n + 1) - hsa - 1);    return 0;&#125;
